{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"32394bb0bb13ad54","type":"group","x":-348,"y":-2260,"width":1432,"height":780,"color":"5","label":"Motivation"},
		{
			"id":"41749fdfbbd1fced",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Phase 04\n## Cleaning up design",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":120,
			"y":-840,
			"width":500,
			"height":130
		},
		{"id":"d9400b1ef0d8d415","type":"file","file":"@projects/0vibes/_backup-remove/phases/P04.md","x":800,"y":-880,"width":500,"height":210},
		{
			"id":"b1f4e56a4ff0f5d8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Knowledge\nSince philosophy is to heavily involve human in the loop - you'll know your projects / frameworks / code much better than through other apps test test\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-320,
			"y":-1735,
			"width":363,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"81606cd9d0b28f14",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Phase 03 \n## Finishing basic functionality",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":120,
			"y":-476,
			"width":500,
			"height":130
		},
		{
			"id":"8ae37c3ec2754ee2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Your child - Love it\nThis project is your child that will be very beneficial (if you have healthy relationship with it)",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":681,
			"y":-1712,
			"width":363,
			"height":175
		},
		{
			"id":"a9cffef4de0ba2eb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Cost\nCheapest way to use LLMs, because you'll have full control over context + philosophy that user should work as well.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":188,
			"y":-2230,
			"width":363,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"4364d0874d7d1f98",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Dev\nBranching allows to have context-efficient exploration inside a task\n\nNo autoapprove allows to avoid the temptation of vibe coding.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":421,
			"y":-1990,
			"width":363,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"ca93242c4526100c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### Psychoanalysis\nYou talk with LLM\nIt can search among other chats \nInsights are easily sent into Anki",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-44,
			"y":-1930,
			"width":363,
			"height":160
		},
		{
			"id":"f16995fca9408cce",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [The Plan - 0vibes](ThePlan.canvas)",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":137,
			"y":-1390,
			"width":465,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"e0c5f9799674e627",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```base\nfilters:\n  and:\n    - 'file.inFolder(\"ThePlan/Job-Career-Finances/0vibes/_reflections\")'\nviews:\n  - type: list\n    name: Reflections\n    order:\n      - file.name\n    sort:\n      - property: file.mtime\n        direction: DESC\n\n```\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
